      "text": [
        "Every price is fixed. Every slot is yours alone.",
        "Booked in named time slots — the price and duration below is exactly what's reserved for you, with no other client sharing the studio.",
        "Services & Prices",
        "Consultation, wash, precision cut, and finish. Theo's standard cut for most clients.",
        "Close, bladed fade blended into length on top, finished with a straight-razor edge.",
        "Cut & Beard",
        "Full cut paired with a shaped and lined beard trim, hot towel included.",
        "Beard Trim & Line-up",
        "Shape, trim, and clean edges with a straight razor finish.",
        "Hot Towel Shave",
        "Traditional wet shave with hot towels, pre-shave oil, and balm finish.",
        "Cut plus a natural-looking grey blend, colour-matched by eye, no dye kit boxes.",
        "Cut, Under 12s",
        "A relaxed, unhurried cut for younger clients — same one-to-one attention."
      ]
    },
